  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Pylons",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Advertisements featuring the company logo, displayed on a steel structure of variable height in a prime location. Eye-catching and visible even from greater distances, making them particularly effective.",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "img",
   "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/635940ec249b210e8902edd4/68d98f0389e1be722af0fd89_totemy-pylony-menu-2-p-500.avif",
   "alt": "",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Totems",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Advertisements designed to attract attention on the road while simultaneously serving as prominent landmarks, simplifying movement in the area and guaranteeing easy navigation.",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "Eye-catching advertising",
   "anchor": "pylony"
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "360° visibility",
   "anchor": "pylony"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Pylons",
   "anchor": "pylony"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Visible advertising mounted on a steel structure is eye-catching and visible even from greater distances, making it particularly effective.",
   "anchor": "pylony"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Graphics: the pylon crown is the primary section where illuminated or non-illuminated advertising, text, or a logo can be placed. The crown can be single-sided, double-sided, triangular, or square.",
   "anchor": "pylony"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Material: the pylon base is galvanised to minimise corrosion or treated with an anti-corrosion coating. The illuminated panels are fitted with energy-saving LED diodes.",
   "anchor": "pylony"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: signage for hypermarkets, shopping centres, company headquarters, and petrol stations. A concrete foundation is required for anchoring, as specified in the structural assessment. For improved safety and easier servicing, service platforms can be added.",
   "anchor": "pylony"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
   "anchor": "pylony"
  },
