  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Freestanding advertisements allow the placement of promotions in locations that require designation and navigation. The shape and design can be customised to suit your needs, offering broad promotional possibilities.",
   "anchor": "totemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Graphics: the display area can feature text, logos, and images designed to capture maximum attention. Illumination is provided by energy-saving LED diodes. Totems can be shaped, curved, or enhanced with 3D lettering.",
   "anchor": "totemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Material: Anchored in a concrete foundation. Smaller units can use an aluminium frame or a hot-dip galvanised steel frame. The cladding can be made of acrylic, composite material or aluminium sheets, to suit the customer’s requirements.",
   "anchor": "totemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: on access roads, at the entrances to complexes, petrol stations, department stores, or wherever signage and navigation are required. Can serve as an orientation system for companies and interiors.",
   "anchor": "totemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
   "anchor": "totemy"
  },
