   "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/635940ec249b210e8902edd4/68d9a14e090cb5cda1eabc40_totemy-pylony-showreel-image.avif",
   "alt": "",
   "anchor": "totemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Decades of custom totems and pylons",
   "anchor": "totemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We have completed hundreds of projects and possess the experience needed to manage any challenge. A testament to this is our record-setting project: the tallest pylon in the Czech Republic—the 37-metre-high Hyundai pylon in Nošovice.",
   "anchor": "totemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The design possibilities for totems and pylons are virtually limitless. We custom-manufacture every structure precisely according to the client's specifications, with advertising towers ranging in height from 1 to 40 metres.",
   "anchor": "totemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Advertising pylons and totems from design to installation",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "We can deliver advertising pylons and totems as a complete turnkey project or take over at any stage of an existing project. We prepare the project design, visualisation, structural calculations, material certificates and production documentation. We also arrange lighting studies and inspections. During project preparation, we can use our lifting equipment to simulate the position and height of the totem on site.",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request production",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "We receive your request",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "By phone: +420 491 482 500 (Mon–Fri 6:00–15:00)",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "By email: eldr@eldr.cz",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Via contact form",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Within 2 business days: We send a price estimate",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "We’ll send a price estimate based on similar completed projects, including reference photos.",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "We’ll ask about key details (size, placement, graphics, background surface, material, interest in design creation).",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Immediately afterwards: We provide a tailored binding quotation",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "We prepare your quotation free of charge.",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Offer includes installation and transport",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Offer can be modified as needed",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Within 4–8 weeks: We install",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "We arrive at the agreed location and install the signage",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "We connect the signage to the power supply",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Trusted by leading Czech and international companies",
   "anchor": "duvera"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Rely on proven quality and join those who already trust us. We will get back to you no later than the next business day.",
   "anchor": "duvera"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
   "anchor": "duvera"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "All references",
   "anchor": "duvera"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Why you should choose our illuminated advertising",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The longest-running illuminated advertising manufacturer in the Czech Republic.",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "High-quality materials and energy-efficient LEDs that will shine brightly for years to come.",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Our illuminated advertising is made entirely in the Czech Republic.",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We provide professional installation and maintenance services.",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We design illuminated advertising tailored to your brand identity.",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
  {
   "type": "img",
   "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/635940ec249b210e8902edd4/6705a6a48e1552c11127cc2e_eldr-emailing-logo.webp",
   "alt": "",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "Illuminated advertising solutions from concept to completion.",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
